:"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/creep#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:b044c79198e642be1f","definition":"Someone creepy (annoyingly unpleasant), especially one who is strange or eccentric.","example":"\"You mentioned some others,\" I said.\n\"More creeps,\" she told me. '\"That guy was plain looking for trouble. You know, he starts hanging out with some of the shooters Whitey Tass keeps around, angling for an introduction to the big man himself, and he's damn lucky he got picked up by the fuzz before Whitey got sore. He runs too big an operation in the city to be bugged by a pig like Yard. One day Lou Steubal tried to get an inside track with Whitey, levering him on account of what Whitey did to his sister, and they found Lou in the drink. It looked like Lou got gassed up and fell in, but don't try to tell me that. Whitey had him tapped out.\"","pos":"noun","synonyms":["creepazoid","creeper","creepoid"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"derogatory, informal","register":"countable, derogatory, informal, uncountable","wordFamily":["becreep","blue creeping gromwell","creepage","creeper","creephole","creep in","creeping barberry","creeping buttercup","creeping Charlie","creeping crud","creeping determinism","creeping disease","creeping elegance","creeping eruption","creeping featurism","creeping fig","creeping gromwell","creeping Jenny","creeping Jesus","creepingly","creeping normality","creeping sage","creeping thistle","creeping thyme","creeping water bug","creeple","creepmouse","creep on","creep out","creep up"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/creep#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d8c831ec7623ab33fb","definition":"A person who engages in sexually inappropriate behaviour or sexual harassment.","example":"It was whispered that the priest was a pervert. Was he? The girls said he wa